  data: {
    LLM: 'Coordinate with your partner. If your partner is close to finishing, help them by winning tricks and leading cards they can beat.\n\nThe Wild Card Advantage: at each level, the hearts of that level are wild. For example, at Level 7, the 7 of hearts is wild. Use it to complete straights or bombs.\n\nBomb Timing: Bombs are powerful but limited. Save them for critical moments, such as when your partner is about to finish or to stop opponents from finishing 1st & 2nd.',
    Player: 'Coordinate with your partner. If your partner is close to finishing, help them by winning tricks and leading cards they can beat.\n\nThe Wild Card Advantage: at each level, the hearts of that level are wild. For example, at Level 7, the 7 of hearts is wild. Use it to complete straights or bombs.\n\nBomb Timing: Bombs are powerful but limited. Save them for critical moments, such as when your partner is about to finish or to stop opponents from finishing 1st & 2nd.',
