    basic: 'Coordinate with your partner. If your partner is close to finishing, help them by winning tricks and leading cards they can beat.',
    intermediate: 'The Wild Card Advantage: at each level, the hearts of that level are wild. For example, at Level 7, the 7 of hearts is wild. Use it to complete straights or bombs.',
